@startuml XhRec 会话状态机
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFDF9
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  BorderColor #2E6DA4
  FontColor #1F3864
}
skinparam transition {
  Color #444444
}

[*] --> Idle : 启动/清理
Idle --> Armed : Scheduler 激活(armed)
Armed --> Fetching : 收到 public/groupShow 且条件满足
Fetching --> Recording : 首次成功拉取 playlist
Fetching --> Armed : 配置失败/暂时不可录
Recording --> Closing : 流结束 / 用户停止 / 错误 / 403/404
Recording --> Recording : 继续轮询、切换画质、触发 CutPoint 后重开分片
Closing --> Idle : 清理完成 / 发布 RecordingStopped
Idle --> [*] : 移除会话

state "Fetching" as Fetching {
  Fetching : 获取 master/media playlist
  Fetching : 获取 token / 自动支付
  Fetching : 选择画质
}

state "Recording" as Recording {
  Recording : 3 秒轮询 playlist
  Recording : 发现新分片 -> Downloader
  Recording : 检查 timeLimit / sizeLimit
  Recording : 收到 StreamEnd / CutPoint
}

note right of Armed
  Scheduler 中 armed 表示“等待直播开始”，
  不一定会创建 Session。
end note

@enduml
